# cyber-pharma — Docker build context excludes
# CRITICAL: .env* keeps local secrets out of the image. Next.js standalone output
# copies .env files into .next/standalone — without this line, .env.local ships
# in the final image and bypasses the 3-Layer secret model.
.env*
node_modules
.next
.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
cloudbuild.yaml
deploy.sh
init-app.sh
agent_docs
_SKILLS
README.md
# Added 2026-11-20 (next-deploy-auto v1.3 baseline merge; existing rules above kept as-is)
upload-secrets.sh
stark-deploy.yaml
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md
.gcloudignore
.auth/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
e2e/
# Added 2026-11-20 (review round 2): nested env and credential files, matching .gcloudignore.
# `.env*` above covers the context root only; these cover every depth.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*service*account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/.auth/
# Case variants of credential file names (canary test 2026-11-20: serviceAccount.json got through).
**/*[sS][eE][rR][vV][iI][cC][eE]*[aA][cC][cC][oO][uU][nN][tT]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*[cC][rR][eE][dD][eE][nN][tT][iI][aA][lL][sS]*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
**/*.[pP][eE][mM]
**/*.[pP]12
**/*.[kK][eE][yY]
